1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 19=

3
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:12,270
Zhang Mingxuan had purchased

4
00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:13,720
many memories on the black market.

5
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,630
Most of them involved

6
00:01:15,630 --> 00:01:17,230
relatively minor offenses.

7
00:01:17,510 --> 00:01:19,270
Among them were Liu Guanghai's memories.

8
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,400
After accessing Liu Guanghai's memories,

9
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,510
Zhang Mingxuan began showing

10
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:24,480
increasingly severe

11
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,080
symptoms of schizophrenia.

12
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:29,190
He claimed Liu Guanghai's
memories influenced him.

13
00:01:29,630 --> 00:01:31,000
He acted on Liu Guanghai's

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,190
unfulfilled desire

15
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:34,680
to kill the mastermind behind the theft.

16
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,310
And he succeeded.

17
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:40,160
Who was the victim?

18
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,080
The fourth person was Liu Ying.

19
00:01:59,270 --> 00:02:00,120
Song Yang.

20
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,740
Are you okay?

21
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,400
I...

22
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,270
Ada.

23
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,910
I need some time alone.

24
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,190
The police are closing in on you.

25
00:02:13,390 --> 00:02:14,360
Leave as soon as possible.

26
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,110
Mr. Liu.

27
00:02:22,190 --> 00:02:24,000
What you've told me is very valuable.

28
00:02:24,190 --> 00:02:25,960
The police will be here soon.

29
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:28,190
Please tell them the truth as well.

30
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,800
Android.

31
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,590
Please,

32
00:02:39,110 --> 00:02:40,630
give this to Siqi.

33
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:48,600
She's all grown up now.

34
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:50,550
She's beautiful, too.

35
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:53,080
But I've never

36
00:02:54,270 --> 00:02:56,240
bought her a single piece of jewelry.

37
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:02,030
I'm begging you.

38
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,670
Please give it to her.

39
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:10,940
I won't have another chance.

40
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:42,500
If Liu Guanghai didn't commit
the murder,

41
00:03:43,450 --> 00:03:44,670
then who did?

42
00:03:44,670 --> 00:03:47,020
(Cedar Underlying Data
Decryption Results)

43
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:51,260
(Activation Command)

44
00:03:53,690 --> 00:03:55,030
Did I have another episode?

45
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,800
Did I hurt someone again?

46
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,270
Have you hurt someone before?

47
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,470
Zhang Mingxuan.

48
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,830
Song Yang.

49
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,270
Do you remember me?

50
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,390
Who are you?

51
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:24,670
Captain Deng.

52
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:26,200
Do you have any more questions?

53
00:04:26,790 --> 00:04:28,040
The officers conducting the search

54
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,000
found Liu Guanghai.

55
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,350
He's been taken to the hospital.

56
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,790
Zhang Mingxuan also confessed
to the crime.

57
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,320
Both his motive

58
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,790
and the timeline match.

59
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,830
And the fingerprints on the knife

60
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:39,000
could very well have been left
by Song Yang

61
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,390
on an earlier occasion.

62
00:04:40,550 --> 00:04:41,200
After all,

63
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,950
it's perfectly normal for a boyfriend

64
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,790
to visit his girlfriend's home.

65
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,040
Something's wrong.

66
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,320
Even if all of that makes sense,

67
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,480
why was the surveillance footage

68
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,550
of Zhang Mingxuan entering
and leaving the crime scene

69
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:56,790
deleted?

70
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Maybe

71
00:04:59,270 --> 00:05:00,640
the cameras happened to malfunction.

72
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,160
That residential area belongs to Cedar.

73
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,000
How could they make such
a basic mistake?

74
00:05:11,230 --> 00:05:12,000
Liu Ying

75
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,790
was the mastermind

76
00:05:16,230 --> 00:05:17,600
behind Liu Guanghai's theft.

77
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:22,040
So Zhang Mingxuan,
influenced by those memories,

78
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:23,440
chose to kill her.

79
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,270
Shen Yu

80
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:28,720
was once a senior researcher at Cedar.

81
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,480
Could her research

82
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,350
be connected to the theft?

83
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,200
Captain Deng.

84
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:40,040
Zhou Zicheng represents
the black market.

85
00:05:40,230 --> 00:05:41,720
MG Group, where Li Senyao works,

86
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,320
has business dealings
with the black market.

87
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:45,950
MG Group.

88
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:50,550
Xiao Minghua

89
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,640
was Cedar's head of security.

90
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,920
So Song Yang

91
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,390
contacted Ada

92
00:05:55,550 --> 00:05:57,880
and obtained the access key for the
surveillance footage in Liu Ying's case.

93
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,760
(Liu Ying and Liu Wenwen,
Mother and Daughter, Truth)

94
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,830
Song Yang wants to clear his name.

95
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,110
(Liu Ying and Liu Wenwen,
Mother and Daughter)

96
00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:04,830
So his next step

97
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,270
is to investigate MG.

98
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,447
That means MG
is connected to the surveillance footage

99
00:06:10,447 --> 00:06:11,540
from the night of the murder.

100
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,270
It all fits together.

101
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:17,670
Attention, everyone.

102
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,760
We've been looking in
the wrong direction from the start.

103
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,790
We thought

104
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:21,550
Liu Ying's case,

105
00:06:21,550 --> 00:06:22,480
Wang Guoqiang's case,

106
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,880
and even the earlier Lu Jiawei case

107
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,040
were all separate cases.

108
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:26,320
But in fact,

109
00:06:26,790 --> 00:06:28,040
they were all connected

110
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,790
from the very beginning.

111
00:06:29,790 --> 00:06:30,760
And that common link

112
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,000
is Cedar.

113
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,160
Based on the evidence we have,

114
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,000
I'm formally announcing

115
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,230
that these cases

116
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:42,760
will be investigated together.

117
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,720
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

118
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:45,830
Team A3.

119
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,600
Go to the hospital
and question Liu Guanghai.

120
00:06:47,790 --> 00:06:48,670
Focus on one thing.

121
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,920
What exactly did they steal

122
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,720
from Cedar Group?

123
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,000
And where did the stolen goods end up?

124
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:53,510
Team A6.

125
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,880
Immediately conduct
another round of interviews

126
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,760
with everyone connected to these cases.

127
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,070
Everyone else,

128
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,760
join me in the search for the android

129
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:04,600
Ada.

130
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,000
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

131
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,070
(That Song Yang...)

132
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:18,070
(He may use unconventional methods,)

133
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:21,320
(but he actually started)

134
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,200
(piecing everything together)

135
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,760
(long before any of us.)

136
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,390
Song Yang.

137
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,270
The necklace Liu Guanghai gave me

138
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,670
isn't an ordinary necklace.

139
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,830
It seems to be some kind
of Cedar research product.

140
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,110
I haven't figured out its purpose yet.

141
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:36,640
I need you to analyze it.

142
00:07:36,770 --> 00:07:38,020
I'm on my way to you.

143
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:42,000
Song Yang.

144
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,520
Are you okay?

145
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,200
Who are you?

146
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,110
An electronically synthesized voice

147
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:54,640
can certainly sound distorted.

148
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,600
Seeing the face I once had

149
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:59,600
might bring back your memories.

150
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,780
But before that,

151
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,550
Song Yang,

152
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:10,890
I've taken control of your base.

153
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,760
For our conversation,

154
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:15,070
I don't want anyone interrupting us.

155
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,670
Aunt Liu.

156
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:27,350
Weren't you...

157
00:08:27,350 --> 00:08:28,230
Already dead?

158
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,790
Yes.

159
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:31,830
The Liu Ying who was

160
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:32,590
driven to despair by you

161
00:08:32,590 --> 00:08:34,000
and by this world

162
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,400
is indeed dead.

163
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,790
The one standing before you

164
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:39,000
is me.

165
00:08:45,470 --> 00:08:46,400
That's impossible.

166
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,150
If you're still alive,

167
00:08:49,150 --> 00:08:50,000
then Wenwen...

168
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:51,520
She...

169
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,910
Could she be...

170
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,710
Song Yang.

171
00:09:00,370 --> 00:09:01,880
After everything you've been through,

172
00:09:03,110 --> 00:09:04,110
you still cling to

173
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:05,790
such unrealistic innocence.

174
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:08,990
I don't know whether to scold you

175
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:11,440
or envy you.

176
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:13,200
By now,

177
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:14,520
you already know

178
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,110
who killed Wenwen.

179
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,110
So,

180
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,230
do you want to know the whole truth?

181
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,960
It begins with something

182
00:09:28,230 --> 00:09:30,790
you could never have imagined.

183
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,110
Nobody knew

184
00:09:33,590 --> 00:09:35,000
that Wenwen actually

185
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,840
always had

186
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,000
two mothers.

187
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,280
Ms. Liu Ying,

188
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,960
as an executive at Cedar Group,

189
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,550
devoted almost all her energy

190
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:45,000
to her work.

191
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:48,400
(Parent-Teacher Meeting Invitation)
So she used her authority

192
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,960
(We Welcome Your Attendance)
to create me.

193
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,590
These inefficient group activities

194
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,030
serve no purpose

195
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,030
other than wasting time.

196
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:57,400
Would you like me to draft

197
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,110
a standard letter declining
the invitation?

198
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,080
How has Wenwen been lately?

199
00:10:02,110 --> 00:10:02,840
Miss Wenwen's

200
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,470
physical indicators are all normal.

201
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:08,280
Her academic progress meets
your expectations.

202
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:09,790
As for her emotional state,

203
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,590
no abnormalities have been detected.

204
00:10:14,590 --> 00:10:15,960
Wenwen is my daughter.

205
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:19,000
I can't let my absence

206
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,200
make her weak or mediocre.

207
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,550
You must become me.

208
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:24,640
Take my place

209
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,550
and carry out my duties and wishes.

210
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:27,400
Do you understand?

211
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,000
Understood.

212
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,590
I completed

213
00:10:32,590 --> 00:10:33,790
the task she gave me perfectly.

214
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,760
I was a good mother to Wenwen.

215
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,520
I did a really good job.

216
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,790
Perhaps

217
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,590
a little too good.

218
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,230
Explain this fluctuation

219
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,400
in your AI Ethics grade,

220
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,470
Liu Wenwen.

221
00:10:47,350 --> 00:10:48,590
Professor Shen mentioned that you seemed

222
00:10:48,590 --> 00:10:49,320
distracted during several

223
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,400
group discussions.

224
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,590
I'm sorry, Mom.

225
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,400
The coursework has been
a little difficult lately.

226
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,790
There's no such word
as difficult in my dictionary.

227
00:10:59,590 --> 00:11:01,590
Only inefficiency
and insufficient effort.

228
00:11:02,110 --> 00:11:03,590
Do you know how much I've done for you?

229
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:04,840
I've already planned

230
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,200
the perfect future for you.

231
00:11:06,820 --> 00:11:08,480
Yet all you do is disappoint me.

232
00:11:09,670 --> 00:11:11,030
A message from Song Yang.

233
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,060
Sorry.

234
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,280
I'm terribly sorry, Ms. Liu Ying.

235
00:11:19,110 --> 00:11:20,200
My system was just running

236
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,320
a self-diagnostic check.

237
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,400
There was a minor balance
calibration error.

238
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:24,760
I'll fix it immediately.

239
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,230
How could your system

240
00:11:26,230 --> 00:11:27,520
make such a basic error?

241
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,200
My apologies again.

242
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:36,720
You can leave now.

243
00:11:41,230 --> 00:11:41,880
Hey.

244
00:11:43,110 --> 00:11:43,790
There.

245
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,200
It's okay.

246
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,120
Don't be afraid.

247
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,480
Mom.

248
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,060
Did you do that on purpose just now?

249
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,980
Professor Shen said

250
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,840
that as androids evolve on their own,

251
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,440
they may eventually
develop consciousness.

252
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:07,550
Don't worry.

253
00:12:07,550 --> 00:12:08,710
I won't tell anyone.

254
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,880
I know you won't.

255
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:12,960
Thank you, Mom.

256
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,280
Mom.

257
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:20,200
I'm so tired.

258
00:12:21,710 --> 00:12:23,080
I really envy Song Yang.

259
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,590
He's free to pursue

260
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:26,080
the things he loves.

261
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,880
Song Yang?

262
00:12:30,230 --> 00:12:32,320
Is he that very smart boy

263
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:34,150
you've been mentioning lately?

264
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,320
He told me about

265
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,440
his new algorithm today.

266
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,400
It's really impressive.

267
00:12:38,910 --> 00:12:39,880
We also made plans

268
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,030
to go to the library this weekend.

269
00:12:41,590 --> 00:12:42,320
But

270
00:12:42,590 --> 00:12:43,790
I'm afraid to tell Mom.

271
00:12:44,710 --> 00:12:45,880
I mean,

272
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:46,960
the other Mom in there.

273
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:48,200
She'd definitely think

274
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,550
it's a waste of time.

275
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,790
No, she wouldn't.

276
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,670
Anyone Wenwen likes

277
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,880
must be a wonderful person.

278
00:12:58,350 --> 00:12:59,910
When you're with him,

279
00:12:59,910 --> 00:13:00,880
are you happy?

280
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,400
Yes.

281
00:13:02,470 --> 00:13:03,440
Very happy.

282
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,710
It's like

283
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,400
everything becomes more enjoyable.

284
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:07,840
That's good.

285
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:09,790
Your happiness

286
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,350
matters more than any
coursework or schedule.

287
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,880
Okay.

288
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,670
If you want to go
this weekend, go ahead.

289
00:13:18,590 --> 00:13:20,320
If Ms. Liu Ying asks,

290
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:22,000
I'll tell her

291
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,080
you're working on
a group research project.

292
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,320
Really?

293
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,200
Thank you, Mom.

294
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,350
You're the best mom in the whole world.

295
00:13:30,470 --> 00:13:31,790
So you are...

296
00:13:43,150 --> 00:13:50,430
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

297
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:56,130
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

298
00:13:56,170 --> 00:13:59,040
♪That's me, too♪

299
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:04,100
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

300
00:14:04,930 --> 00:14:08,400
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

301
00:14:09,020 --> 00:14:12,810
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

302
00:14:13,130 --> 00:14:15,660
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

303
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,260
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

304
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:22,390
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

305
00:14:22,390 --> 00:14:25,560
♪Bring me something more?♪

306
00:14:26,260 --> 00:14:32,990
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

307
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:37,220
♪Sadness is blue♪

308
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:41,440
♪How would you paint me?♪

309
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:46,170
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

310
00:14:46,270 --> 00:14:48,430
♪Painting without restraint♪

311
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:51,210
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

312
00:14:51,210 --> 00:14:55,400
♪If I could start over♪

313
00:14:55,570 --> 00:14:59,470
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

314
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:02,220
♪Give me back my smile♪

315
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:05,300
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

316
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:11,040
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
